'' A procedure name is declared once per scope: fbc error 4 on ANY second DECLARE of a
'' name already declared or defined there, whatever differs -- and on a second body.
'' Overload sets, members and operators take a new signature, never the same one.
'' Every line asserted below is a line fbc-modern 1.20 and 1.10.1 report, and none else:
'' measured 2026-09-18, 19 errors from each -- line 33's TKO0677 is tiko's own: a later
'' OVERLOAD joins a set (RFC-0001 F4), and fbc's error 4 there stands only because these
'' parameters cannot be told apart. MAX-DIAG is what proves nothing is reported
'' twice or cascades. Line 73 is the unknown rank, judged by Collect since 2026-09-18;
'' line 76, an array element's CONST, by the late sweep.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/duplicate-declare.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 19
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(8,9): error TKO0600: 'dupsame'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(11,9): error TKO0600: 'duplib'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(16,9): error TKO0600: 'dupparams'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(18,9): error TKO0600: 'dupkind'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(20,9): error TKO0600: 'dupalias'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(25,9): error TKO0600: 'dupafterdef'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(28,1): error TKO0600: 'duptwobodies'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(33,9): error TKO0677: 'duplatekw'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(38,9): error TKO0677: 'dupoverload'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(40,9): error TKO0677: 'dupmode'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(47,13): error TKO0600: 'inner'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(52,9): error TKO0600: 'dupextern'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(58,13): error TKO0677: 'm'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(60,13): error TKO0677: 'p'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(62,13): error TKO0677: 'constructor'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(64,13): error TKO0677: 'destructor'
'' EXPECT-OUT: duplicate-declare.bas(69,9): error TKO0677: '+'
